---
name: review
description: {{ ("Review the uncommitted changes in every service of " ~ ws.name ~ ", including whether they still agree on their contracts") | tojson }}
disable-model-invocation: true
---

Review the uncommitted changes across the services of {{ ws.name }}.

1. Find the changes in each service:
<!-- agent-scaffold:service-diffs -->
{% if not services %}
   - No services yet.
{% endif %}
{% for service, s in services %}
{% if ws.layout == "repos" %}
   - `{{ service.path }}`: `git -C {{ service.path }} diff HEAD`
{% else %}
   - `{{ service.path }}`: `git diff HEAD -- {{ service.path }}`
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
<!-- /agent-scaffold:service-diffs -->
2. For each changed service, read its `AGENTS.md` and the rules in its `.claude/rules/` that match the changed files.
3. Look for correctness bugs first, then contract mismatches between services (a changed API, event or schema whose consumers weren't updated), then missing tests and convention violations.
4. Run the test command of each changed service, as listed in `AGENTS.md`.

Report findings grouped by service, most severe first, each with file:line and a concrete fix.
